WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.901
Roxy watched the chemical cloud move across more farm fields.

2
00:00:05.902 --> 00:00:09.930
Loud footsteps shook the ground.

3
00:00:09.931 --> 00:00:14.460
"I don't know if Blue Baboon is in that cloud," said Roxy.

4
00:00:14.461 --> 00:00:17.624
"But it's heading straight toward Metro City.

5
00:00:17.625 --> 00:00:19.818
I have to stop it!"

6
00:00:19.819 --> 00:00:23.126
Roxy flew fast toward the chemical cloud.

7
00:00:23.127 --> 00:00:27.980
It was now in Mr. Mann's cornfield.

8
00:00:27.981 --> 00:00:32.830
She took a deep breath and then blew. Whoosh!

9
00:00:32.831 --> 00:00:36.644
A huge hand popped out of the cloud and smacked Roxy.

10
00:00:36.645 --> 00:00:39.977
Whack! She tumbled through the air.

11
00:00:39.978 --> 00:00:43.766
By the time she landed, the cloud was gone.

12
00:00:43.767 --> 00:00:48.158
An enormous baboon, covered in glowing chemicals, stood in the field.

13
00:00:48.159 --> 00:00:50.522
The baboon was scratching himself.

14
00:00:50.523 --> 00:00:52.321
He looked angry.

15
00:00:52.322 --> 00:00:54.693
"Oh boy," said Roxy.

16
00:00:54.694 --> 00:00:57.419
"That's definitely Blue Baboon.

17
00:00:57.420 --> 00:01:00.118
But he's as tall as a building!

18
00:01:00.119 --> 00:01:03.244
The chemicals must have made him grow!"

19
00:01:03.245 --> 00:01:07.811
"Wah-hu! Wah-hu!" Blue Baboon barked.

20
00:01:07.812 --> 00:01:12.823
The giant baboon scratched his side and then stomped toward Roxy.

21
00:01:12.824 --> 00:01:14.737
He opened his mouth wide.

22
00:01:14.738 --> 00:01:17.785
His fangs were huge and sharp.

23
00:01:17.786 --> 00:01:20.110
"Uh-oh!" Roxy cried.

24
00:01:20.111 --> 00:01:24.117
Blue Baboon swatted at Roxy, who quickly dodged the blow.

25
00:01:24.118 --> 00:01:27.250
The baboon barked again.

26
00:01:27.251 --> 00:01:31.217
Then he scratched and stomped on Mr. Mann's barn.

27
00:01:31.218 --> 00:01:36.369
Smash! The barn shattered into tiny pieces.

28
00:01:36.370 --> 00:01:39.998
Mr. Mann ran out of his house.

29
00:01:39.999 --> 00:01:45.713
"What happened to my—?" He looked up and saw Blue Baboon.

30
00:01:45.714 --> 00:01:51.959
"Aah!" Mr. Mann ran back into his house and hid under his bed.

31
00:01:51.960 --> 00:01:56.661
"Wah-hu! Wah-hu!" Blue Baboon barked angrily.

32
00:01:56.662 --> 00:02:01.802
He stomped. He scratched. "Wah-hu! Wah-hu!"

33
00:02:01.803 --> 00:02:04.977
Roxy watched Blue Baboon scratch his shoulder.

34
00:02:04.978 --> 00:02:08.972
Then he turned around and stomped across the field.

35
00:02:08.973 --> 00:02:12.198
He was heading toward Metro City again.

36
00:02:12.199 --> 00:02:16.597
"I can't let Blue Baboon reach Metro City!" Roxy thought.

37
00:02:16.598 --> 00:02:20.276
"He'll destroy every building in the city!"

38
00:02:20.277 --> 00:02:23.679
Roxy flew after the giant baboon.

39
00:02:23.680 --> 00:02:25.970
She wrapped her arms around his foot.

40
00:02:25.971 --> 00:02:29.198
Glowing chemicals got all over her.

41
00:02:29.199 --> 00:02:32.694
"Wah-hu!" Blue Baboon jerked his foot.

42
00:02:32.695 --> 00:02:36.501
He shook Roxy off. Then he kicked her hard.

43
00:02:36.502 --> 00:02:41.635
Roxy sailed through the air and crashed into a tractor. "Oof!"

44
00:02:41.636 --> 00:02:45.385
She stood up, still covered in the glowing chemicals.

45
00:02:45.386 --> 00:02:49.187
She scratched. Then she scratched some more.

46
00:02:49.188 --> 00:02:53.337
"Grr!" Roxy's face turned red.

47
00:02:53.338 --> 00:02:55.843
"Why am I so itchy?"

48
00:02:55.844 --> 00:02:59.680
She stomped her foot and scratched some more.

49
00:02:59.681 --> 00:03:02.325
Roxy gritted her teeth.

50
00:03:02.326 --> 00:03:07.420
"Ack! This is awful! I can't stop itching.

51
00:03:07.421 --> 00:03:13.254
I'm getting really, really angry!"

